{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ninja Ming</i> is a precision platformer with a teleportation twist. Play as Ming the ninja and take on the Path of Trial through 8 chapters and 241 levels.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dash? Flash! Teleportation is Key.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/kunai_gif.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw a kunai and instantly teleport to its location! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ninja Ming relies heavily on the move of teleportation. Once mastered, you\u2019ll be commanding the air and dashing through the challenging areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/Untitled_design__7_.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Ninjutsu Skillset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Flash&quot; is just the beginner skill! As you progress through levels, you'll unlock even more dazzling abilities: use &quot;ExFlash&quot; for long-range teleportation, destroy (or build) terrain with &quot;Fireball&quot; and &quot;Rock,&quot; and find creative solutions with &quot;Replacement Dash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each terrain presents unique puzzles - Use your skill combinations to plan the best routes and maximize your mobility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/combo_gif.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exploration + Puzzles = Scrolls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While dashing forward, don\u2019t forget to explore\u2014each room contains collectible &quot;scrolls&quot;! Find different ways to unlock them - &quot;Flash Scrolls&quot; requires multiple Flashes to unlock, &quot;Treasure Chest Scrolls&quot; can only be opened with keys, &quot;Timed Scrolls&quot; tests your aerial ability, and &quot;Secret Scrolls&quot; are tucked away in corners.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ninja Ming\u2019s Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three years ago, with the appearance of a time-space rift, natural disasters struck the ninja world. Ninja Mirror and the Four Ninjas  sealed the rift together but were never seen again since. Three years later, a ninja named &quot;Ming&quot; inherits the will of the ninjas and embarks on his trial journey, searching for Mirror, and undergoing his own transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not have any form of stats growth. It'll only be you and your controls. Keep growing, and you shall master precision, speed, and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/4.png?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assist Mode</strong>: You can adjust the game speed to a minimum of 0.3x.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anecdotes</strong>: Keep track of your encounters and acquired ninjutsu.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>: Unlocks after completing any area. You will be timed in this mode. Welcome speedrunners! (Current world record for the first chapter &quot;Forest&quot; is 102.73s, held by Tichat002).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smooth Controls</strong>: Precise control over movement and skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Instant Respawn</strong>: Quickly respawn and resume the challenge after failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eight Areas</strong>: Forming the ultimate trial for aspiring ninjas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Electronic Music</strong> (by 4 Channels Club): Keeps your cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scroll Portal</strong>: Complete the first 4 chapters to unlock, and enter the next 4 chapters of Inner World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Achievements, and plenty of Easter Eggs!</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FOREST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/1b91754c75e1d6c12b5c7b7c8d70840de3770712.jpg"},{"name":"WIND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/6dd21bfa0ab8185362051b24294b1485d0832db9.jpg"},{"name":"MOUNTAIN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/616c65f3eb5bb700efa127996c879e82035c1a9b.jpg"},{"name":"FIRE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/53d43d8006a831cd7f53e35edb7d38b503836f31.jpg"},{"name":"If I Were King of Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/2ad781e62ee5c713e2243174b519e230002db331.jpg"},{"name":"Gone with the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/e0e87384df4aa30387e9babffdc62ceb5748d8cf.jpg"},{"name":"The Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/ea71cf035b274bf6efa8db2223c0bd4973cc4fe8.jpg"},{"name":"Play with Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/55180e9803ec21ec1173e12ca7f1846b01ee0c8a.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Ming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/d248d54e33099edf24eaedaa3fff9a00059cea5a.jpg"},{"name":"Collector of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3234330/9e9008518e4edef407ea99e74770c951c602766a.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3234330?t=1744352514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744352514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/daa8dda7a820721a5ac25002caed18f871309b15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744352514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/daa8dda7a820721a5ac25002caed18f871309b15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744352514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ninja Ming</i> is a precision platformer with a teleportation twist. Play as Ming the ninja and take on the Path of Trial through 8 chapters and 241 levels.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dash? Flash! Teleportation is Key.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/kunai_gif.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw a kunai and instantly teleport to its location! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ninja Ming relies heavily on the move of teleportation. Once mastered, you\u2019ll be commanding the air and dashing through the challenging areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/Untitled_design__7_.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Ninjutsu Skillset</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Flash&quot; is just the beginner skill! As you progress through levels, you'll unlock even more dazzling abilities: use &quot;ExFlash&quot; for long-range teleportation, destroy (or build) terrain with &quot;Fireball&quot; and &quot;Rock,&quot; and find creative solutions with &quot;Replacement Dash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each terrain presents unique puzzles - Use your skill combinations to plan the best routes and maximize your mobility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/combo_gif.gif?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exploration + Puzzles = Scrolls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While dashing forward, don\u2019t forget to explore\u2014each room contains collectible &quot;scrolls&quot;! Find different ways to unlock them - &quot;Flash Scrolls&quot; requires multiple Flashes to unlock, &quot;Treasure Chest Scrolls&quot; can only be opened with keys, &quot;Timed Scrolls&quot; tests your aerial ability, and &quot;Secret Scrolls&quot; are tucked away in corners.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ninja Ming\u2019s Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three years ago, with the appearance of a time-space rift, natural disasters struck the ninja world. Ninja Mirror and the Four Ninjas  sealed the rift together but were never seen again since. Three years later, a ninja named &quot;Ming&quot; inherits the will of the ninjas and embarks on his trial journey, searching for Mirror, and undergoing his own transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game does not have any form of stats growth. It'll only be you and your controls. Keep growing, and you shall master precision, speed, and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/extras/4.png?t=1744352514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assist Mode</strong>: You can adjust the game speed to a minimum of 0.3x.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anecdotes</strong>: Keep track of your encounters and acquired ninjutsu.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>: Unlocks after completing any area. You will be timed in this mode. Welcome speedrunners! (Current world record for the first chapter &quot;Forest&quot; is 102.73s, held by Tichat002).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smooth Controls</strong>: Precise control over movement and skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Instant Respawn</strong>: Quickly respawn and resume the challenge after failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Eight Areas</strong>: Forming the ultimate trial for aspiring ninjas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Electronic Music</strong> (by 4 Channels Club): Keeps your cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scroll Portal</strong>: Complete the first 4 chapters to unlock, and enter the next 4 chapters of Inner World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Achievements, and plenty of Easter Eggs!</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["1 Poss Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234330/77c7c96da6fd1280a0279134358708a4177c06e5/header.jpg?t=1744352514","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Both Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124771,"mp4":{"480":"htt